        },
        {
          "text": " Koŋolia ŋes Asaria esasedoti lopeti, ka isasedotin kere, ido koany, ejai atapon oreeteke, kisunyas aremor ŋes kiŋa; eebo, kisunya ŋesi da elopet alomar, naarai enomit EJAKAIT ŋes. ",
